#   - COLOR green shadowed by COLOR blue (DCE: removes COLOR green)
#   - FORWARD 30 + FORWARD 30 merged into FORWARD 60 (peephole)
#   - LEFT 45 + RIGHT 45 cancelled (peephole: net zero rotation)
